            05  WS-TH776-RADICAL-NTT-OK     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH777-KMEANS-TWID-OK     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH778-NTT-STEP-LAT-OK    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
